### INSTANCED GEOMETRY

    vertex buffer a: 1 set  of "per vertex attributes"
    vertex buffer b: n sets of "per object attributes" (INSTANCES BUFFER)
    OR
    vertex buffer a: 1 set  of "per vertex attributes"
    and a uniform buffer with all instaced attributes data  "uniform vec2 wpos[100];" (a limit on the amount of uniform data count)

    where these 2 buffers belong?
    who controls them?

                                 { VPOSI2 }
